### 1. POS Checkout API
POST http://localhost:3000/pos/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomor_whatsapp": "628123456789",
  "cashier_id": "KASIR-01",
  "payment_method": "CASH",
  "items": [
    {
      "paket_id": "PAKET-REGULER",
      "harga": 20000,
      "qty": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Webhook Payment Gateway API
POST http://localhost:3000/pos/webhook/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pos_trx_id": "b82f53cc-49e5-400c-a921-5e13b47555df",
  "transaction_status": "settlement"
}